{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211460","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121146001:1":{"text":"...멈추세요!","source_cn":"……大家停步！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38B56E9B48FE18D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121146002:1":{"text":"이 기운.. 악마예요. 바로 근처에 있어요!","source_cn":"这股气息……是恶魔。就在这附近！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA128DDDFAB157AC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121146003:1":{"text":"네? 악마요? 어디요? 치피가 모두를 지키겠어요!","source_cn":"什么，恶魔？！在哪里！？满满要保护大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA48C9775BC0ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121146004:1":{"text":"기운이 우리에게서 굉장히 빨리 멀어지고 있어요... 도망치게 두어선 안 돼요!","source_cn":"气息在远离我们，速度很快……不能让他逃走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9570B3964376C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121146005:1":{"text":"너무 위험해요. 여러분은 따라오지 마세요. 제가 가죠!","source_cn":"太危险了，你们不要跟来，我去追上他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED639C41D34D7C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121146006:1":{"text":"엇, 탈렌 양...! 잠깐만요!","source_cn":"诶，塔琳小姐——！等等呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410AC632E592EEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:11:1121147001:":{"text":"악마, 도망갈 생각 마라!","source_cn":"恶魔，别想逃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33934A99175D803D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121146007:1":{"text":"와, 날아갔어요...","source_cn":"哇，她振翅飞走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C6B8C2C677D8250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121146008:1":{"text":"저기... 방금 그 낯선 분이... 악마라고 하신 건가요?","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，刚才那位陌生的女士，是不是提到了——恶魔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29CEAC8C212D5014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1121146008":{"text":"저기... 방금 그 낯선 분이... 악마라고 하신 건가요?","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，刚才那位陌生的女士，是不是提到了——恶魔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29CEAC8C212D5014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121146009:2":{"text":"그렇군요. 기억을 잃은 반신과 정체 불명의 악마, 그리고 두 개가 된 여신상이라...","source_cn":"原来如此，失忆的半神与身份不明的恶魔，还有神秘增加的神像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441B319FA5348C98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121146010:1":{"text":"다들 와주셔서 정말 감사해요, 마침 여기에서도 같은 일이 일어났습니다.","source_cn":"感谢诸位愿意前来。同样的事情正在发生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF439C3796D350C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121146011:1":{"text":"네... 네? 같은 일이요?","source_cn":"什——什么？同样的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1523806170311245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121146012:1":{"text":"설마 사슴 영혼 조각상도 두 개로 변한 건가요?","source_cn":"难道鹿灵雕像也变成了两个？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D5340CCC1E509A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121146013:1":{"text":"조금 달라요.","source_cn":"略有不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A897C86658CF9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121146014:3":{"text":"우선 영혼의 언덕으로 가시겠습니까? 아니면 여기서 탈렌 양이 돌아오기를 기다리시겠습니까?","source_cn":"那么，诸位是要直接前往鹿灵圣丘，或是在这里等待塔琳女士回归？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE279CF7D091AC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121146015:1":{"text":"치피는 조금 불안하긴 한데... 악마잖아요! 우리가 지금까지 만난 악마들은 전부 위험하고 교활했다고요!","source_cn":"满满还是不放心……那可是恶魔哇！我们见过的恶魔都又阴险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13881E36F99514B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121146016:1":{"text":"아무리 반신이라 해도... 탈렌 양은 혼자인데다 기억까지 잃었잖아요...","source_cn":"就算半神有对抗恶魔的力量，但就塔琳她一个人，而且还失忆了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4185BC8487CA1A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1121146016":{"text":"아무리 반신이라 해도... 탈렌 양은 혼자인데다 기억까지 잃었잖아요...","source_cn":"就算半神有对抗恶魔的力量，但就塔琳她一个人，而且还失忆了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4185BC8487CA1A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1121146019:0":{"text":"아무래도 걱정된다면 우선은 탈렌 양을 쫓아가는 게 좋겠어요. 저희도 악마를 상대한 건 한두 번이 아니니 분명 도움이 될 거예요!","source_cn":"要是不放心的话，还是先追上塔琳小姐吧。我们也不是第一次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x779E2D602A310C14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"우리가 찾으러 가자!","source_cn":"我们去找她吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8C96003AF417B7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리가 찾으러 가자!","